  "content": "Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa.Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa.Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa.Buddhaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.Dhammaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.Saṅghaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.Dutiyampi buddhaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.Dutiyampi dhammaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.Dutiyampi saṅghaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.Tatiyampi buddhaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.Tatiyampi dhammaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.Tatiyampi saṅghaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.Pāṇātipātā veramaṇī sikkhāpadaṃ samādiyāmi.Adinnādānā veramaṇī sikkhāpadaṃ samādiyāmi.Kāmesu micchācārā veramaṇī sikkhāpadaṃ samādiyāmi.Musāvādā veramaṇī sikkhāpadaṃ samādiyāmi.Surāmeraya-majja-pamādaṭṭhānā veramaṇī sikkhāpadaṃ samādiyāmi.Tisaraṇena saha pañcasīlaṃ dhammaṃ sādhukaṃ surakkhitaṃ katvā appamādena sampādetha.Āma bhante.Sādhu! Sādhu! Sādhu!",
